WEBVTT

NOTE English captions for https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BnU535dqG6U, from YouTube, repeats removed.

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.130
What comes to mind when you think about success and productivity?

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:07.120
For me, like probably most people today, the first thing that comes to mind are the

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.820
billionaires and entrepreneurs that are household names.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.809
I mean, clearly, they must be doing something right with their their time if they “made

00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:14.033
it this in far life.”

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.600
But of course, that’s because our world today defines success based on fame and wealth.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.064
The more money you want, the more productive you must be.

00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:24.267
I’d like to think that, as Muslims, we can agree that our lives are not defined

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.093
by these goals.

00:00:25.093 --> 00:00:29.365
And before we talk about tips to implement good habits, we’ve got to reorient the purpose

00:00:29.365 --> 00:00:30.355
we’re here for.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.033
One of the most powerful sayings of the Prophet (saw) that really captures not simply our

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:47.520
purpose in life, but the direct and immediate role Allah (swt) has in facilitating our affairs

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.716
is one in which he states: Man kanat al-akhiratu hammahu, that the person who make the

00:00:51.716 --> 00:00:59.015
next life their primary concern--hammahu--their goals, their desires, ja’al Allahu ghinahu fi qalbihi, Allah (swt) will

00:00:59.015 --> 00:01:04.992
place wealth or abundance in their hearts, wa-jama’a lahu shamlahu, and He will organize this person’s

00:01:04.992 --> 00:01:09.960
affairs, wa-atathu al-dunya wa-hiya raghima--and this world will come to them whether it-- here meaning the

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.040
world--wants to or not.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.620
This is incredibly profound because it puts our lives into so much perspective.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.960
When we revolve our decisions and actions around the intention and the constant goal of pursuing

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.069
God’s pleasure in the next life, all of the doors of this world will open right

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:23.840
before your eyes.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:28.480
Allah promises us that the world--no matter how corrupt we humans make it--the world will still

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:32.137
come to you, the believer seeking everything but the world.

00:01:32.137 --> 00:01:34.577
Wa jama’a lahu shamlahu--such an incredible promise.

00:01:34.577 --> 00:01:38.880
Translating it as “Allah will organize this person’s affairs” doesn’t do this statement justice.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.220
Imagine an endless list of tasks that you have to get through.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:45.240
Some are work related, some family, some personal.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:49.206
Some need hours of attention, while others require running countless errands.

00:01:49.206 --> 00:01:54.515
When the Prophet (saw) says that Allah will jama’a lahu shamlahu, it means that all of

00:01:54.515 --> 00:01:59.244
those endless tasks, that seemed scattered and require so much time, will effortlessly come together.

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:03.097
And you’ll suddenly find yourself accomplishing multiple tasks quickly and with ease.

00:02:03.097 --> 00:02:07.075
In other words, the person who keeps their eyes on the prize and truly defines their

00:02:07.075 --> 00:02:11.784
life based on the purpose they were created for, will not only be blessed in their

00:02:11.784 --> 00:02:17.109
time and work, but most importantly, ja’ala Allahu ghinahu fi qalbihi--Allah will fill their heart with

00:02:17.109 --> 00:02:22.000
a sense of abundance, accomplishment, and true fulfillment that very few people in this world experience.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.920
The hadith, however, doesn’t stop there.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:28.061
On the flip side, we learn of the consequences of those whose sole focus in this

00:02:28.061 --> 00:02:32.880
world--the intention behind which they build their goals and habits--is in pursuit of this world alone,

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.680
and the fame and riches it offers.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:39.585
Allah says in regard to these people, they will only ever get exactly what has been

00:02:39.585 --> 00:02:41.655
decreed for them--no more, no less.

00:02:41.655 --> 00:02:46.720
Meaning that they are entirely deprived of any form of barakah--or blessing in one’s time, efforts,

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.414
health, family, you name it.

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:53.260
And on top of that, farraqa aw shattata alayhi shamlahu, their affairs will be scattered.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:57.080
Think back again to that endless list of tasks you need to accomplish.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.781
Think of each task as a paper stacked on your desk.

00:02:59.781 --> 00:03:01.373
You’ve got a pile to get through.

00:03:01.373 --> 00:03:05.412
When the Prophet says that Allah will scatter their affairs, imagine that huge pile of papers

00:03:05.412 --> 00:03:08.838
on your desk flying in the wind and scattering in every direction.

00:03:08.838 --> 00:03:13.120
You’re then left running to chase after each task, making everything that much harder and more

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:17.530
time consuming. And at the end of the day, the one who is looking only to

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:22.474
find happiness in this world, ja’ala Allahu faqrahu bayna aynayhi--that Allah will stamp poverty, a lack

00:03:22.474 --> 00:03:25.422
of success, that sense of emptiness, between that person’s eyes.

00:03:25.422 --> 00:03:29.745
Which is to say that, such a person, no matter how hard they try, will never

00:03:29.745 --> 00:03:32.187
gain a true sense of accomplishment in this world.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.868
Real achievement is far from the lives of the multi million and billionaires we are so

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:36.673
familiar with today.

00:03:36.673 --> 00:03:41.257
Our lives have meaning so much greater than that, and only by living in hopes of

00:03:41.296 --> 00:03:46.161
fulfilling our true purpose will we experience our peak productivity and success.
